  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a standard action, the field specialist can swing his gun arm in a large, wide arc to blast all enemies close by with energy from his gun arm. He deals 1d10 points of fire damage for every two field specialist levels in a 30-ft.-cone. A successful Reflex save (DC 10 + half of the field specialist’s level + his Charisma modifier) reduces this damage by half.</p>",
